title    Dune Rider
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Desert option "dunerider": fast desert trance in F minor. A plucked harpsichord ostinato (a qanun stand-in) runs sixteenths through the Phrygian G-flat chord, congas and bongos ride a four-on-the-floor bigkick, and a supersaw carries the hook. The last eight bars lift a tone. Layers: ostinato, rolling FM bass and hand drums, then the kit at 2x, the supersaw at 3x, a twang guitar doubling the hook and sixteenth hats at FRENZY.
tempo    168
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.24

# untagged voices are the base layer; the intro plays every layer
voice ost    harpsichord vol=0.3  pan=0.3
voice bass   fmbass      vol=0.6  gate=0.6
voice conga  conga       vol=0.5  pan=-0.35
voice bongo  bongo       vol=0.44 pan=0.4
voice kick   bigkick     vol=0.52 layer=drums
voice clap   clap909     vol=0.42 pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice ohat   ohat909     vol=0.24 pan=-0.25 layer=drums
voice crash  crash       vol=0.32 pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice rise   riser       vol=0.28 layer=drums
voice lead   supersaw    vol=0.8  layer=lead
voice twang  guitar      vol=0.55 pan=-0.3 oct=-1 bright=1.4 layer=frenzy
voice hat    hat909      vol=0.3  pan=0.3 layer=frenzy

